# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-3 window (octo-T8 and its three levers on the fused stack; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-3 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo3-1 is the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (the oneq arm needs its binary; every other arm runs that
# binary with the lever off). A commit of a file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# A2 (EXACTNESS of the whole candidate stack, SOFT): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-oneq-grid13-octo3-audit = A1's arm on the combined prefill arm
# (the prefill SDPA with one q chunk per core, QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_ONEQ=1, and the 13x10 matmul grids, QWEN_FAST_GRID13=1, each with its audit): the image's K64j-OQ binary
# running the octo levers. warmup, the solo prefill ladder (the prefill levers in every chunk) and concurrent8_steady (the octo rounds). READ: A1's rules plus the oneq and
# grid13 markers (grid13_smoke) and no fell-back line of either; a "lacks the oneq edits" error means the image is not B0's. The prefill levers act on prefill and the octo
# levers on decode: this job proves the two compose exactly; their gains are F2's (prefill) and the L-pairs' (decode). TELEMETRY (C2_TELEMETRY=1,
# scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py): the read-only ARC sidecar samples every chip once a second through the smoke step; read telemetry-smoke/telemetry-summary.txt beside the
# result, and the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. A gain that comes with a different loaded AICLK between the arms is the clocks, not the lever. Duration
# (estimate): 90 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo3-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-oneq-grid13-octo3-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,prefill_ladder_solo,concurrent8_steady
C2_TELEMETRY=1
C2_BOX_MINUTES=120
